BT /F2 13.0 Tf 50.0 586.0 Td (1. State the gas model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 50.0 565.0 Td (For fixed mass of ideal gas, pV = mRT. At fixed volume and mass, p/T is constant, so p2 =) Tj ET
